<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-27708] openSock is not updated in ClientImpl</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-27708</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;After &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-26582&quot; title=&quot;Thick client optimizations for MultiDC&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-26582&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-26582&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; openSock local variable in &#160;org.apache.ignite.spi.discovery.tcp.ClientImpl#sendJoinRequest is not changing. Because of that we have dead code in catch block&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Research do we need the variable&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Remove dead code if we don&apos;t&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
</description>
